WEBVTT

cd-en-001
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:05.256
At noon, witnesses reported hearing
a bell from a tower that has no bell.

cd-en-002
00:00:07.228 --> 00:00:11.720
The mounting frame was empty, with no
instrument there that could make the sound.

cd-en-003
00:00:13.692 --> 00:00:19.181
The empty frame can be verified, but no bell
or other sound-making device has been found.

cd-en-004
00:00:21.153 --> 00:00:23.500
What produced the sound is still unknown.

cd-en-005
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:29.399
Clock repairer Mira is following a trail of
clues that may relate to her missing brother.

cd-en-006
00:00:33.605 --> 00:00:37.772
Among the workshop materials is a
handwritten note said to have come from him.

cd-en-007
00:00:41.978 --> 00:00:46.831
A brass moth lies beside it, though no
one knows what the object was meant for.

cd-en-008
00:00:51.037 --> 00:00:56.189
The time nine seventeen recurs in clocks
and records, alongside the note and moth.

cd-en-009
00:01:00.395 --> 00:01:04.500
Together they form a pattern, but
not proof of where her brother is.

cd-en-010
00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:09.070
The note leads Mira to a ledger
divided into two columns.

cd-en-011
00:01:13.322 --> 00:01:17.557
One column lists minutes; the
other column lists people's names.

cd-en-012
00:01:21.809 --> 00:01:26.398
The pages show that structure, but they
do not show the ledger causing anything.

cd-en-013
00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:36.500
There is no proof that it steals time, makes
people disappear, or records real losses.

cd-en-014
00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:41.535
The note also turns Mira's
investigation toward the city council.

cd-en-015
00:01:45.475 --> 00:01:50.525
The accusation raises suspicion, but it does
not prove that the council was involved.

cd-en-016
00:01:54.465 --> 00:01:57.884
No one knows where the ledger came
from or whether it is genuine.

cd-en-017
00:02:01.824 --> 00:02:05.971
The evidence leaves the council's
possible role and motive equally unclear.

cd-en-018
00:02:09.911 --> 00:02:15.499
No known link connects the council to the ledger,
the missing brother, or the tower incident.

cd-en-019
00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:24.948
What is known is the empty frame, the report of a bell, the
note, brass moth, nine seventeen, and two-column ledger.

cd-en-020
00:02:28.229 --> 00:02:32.144
The note, moth, and repeated time
form a trail through the evidence.

cd-en-021
00:02:35.425 --> 00:02:38.795
The ledger's meaning and any
power behind it are still unknown.

cd-en-022
00:02:42.076 --> 00:02:45.742
The bell's source and Mira's brother's
location have not been found.

cd-en-023
00:02:49.023 --> 00:02:52.891
No evidence yet connects the council
to the ledger or the tower incident.

cd-en-024
00:02:56.172 --> 00:02:59.499
For now, the tower remains under investigation.
